FailedToDeleteRoutingID=Het verwijderen van het routeringsadres is mislukt.
FailedToSetDefaultRoutingID=Het instellen van het standaard routeringsadres is mislukt.
EInvoicingSellerIdByBuyer=Our supplier ID at this customer
EInvoicingSellerIdByBuyerHelp=Identifier this customer gave us as its supplier (vendor code), sent as BT-29 on the e-invoices addressed to it. Leave empty if the customer did not ask for it.
FailedToSaveSellerIdByBuyer=Failed to save our supplier ID at this customer
